          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_compares_lstm_transformer_decoders_e",
          "text": "It compares LSTM and Transformer decoders as the explanation generator, and, crucially, shows through a large human study that the standard string-matching metrics like BLEU and ROUGE are unreliable for judging explanations, motivating better evaluation.",
